OL,3,GNEWSAExecutive's early promise has
OL,4,A'evaporated' - SDLP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current Stormont Executive's "early
OL,7,Fpromise has evaporated", the leader of
OL,8,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,9,F(SDLP) is to tell their annual
OL,10,Fconference.
OL,12,FClaire Hanna will say Northern
OL,13,FIreland's four-party coalition is
OL,14,Foffering "more chaff than change" with
OL,15,F"big decisions kicked back into the
OL,16,Flong grass".
OL,18,FStormont's larger parties have now
OL,19,Fturned to "raking over the past instead
OL,20,Fof a focus on the future", the MP is
OL,21,Fexpected to say in her speech.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
